(56, 7, 'en', 'High-quality education following Iranian Ministry of Education standards, focusing on personal growth and strengthening the cultural identity of Iranian students in Dubai. Our educational path includes supportive programs for personal growth and character development in a multicultural environment.', '2025-05-19 13:50:39', '2025-05-19 13:50:39'),
