(80, 1, 'en', 'Privacy Policy', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(81, 2, 'en', 'Important information about how we collect, use, and protect your personal data', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(82, 3, 'en', 'Introduction', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(83, 4, 'en', 'At Salman Farsi Educational Complex, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our website, educational management system, or any of our other services.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(84, 5, 'en', 'This policy applies to all data collected through student registrations, system logins, grade viewing, and the use of our other educational and digital services. Please read this policy carefully to understand our practices regarding your personal information.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(85, 6, 'en', 'Salman Farsi Educational Complex, as an educational institution, is committed to maintaining the security and privacy of information related to students, parents, and staff.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(86, 7, 'en', 'Information We Collect', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(87, 8, 'en', 'We collect personal information for the purpose of providing educational services, managing student records, and communicating with students and parents. This information is typically provided during registration, account creation, or interaction with our educational management system.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(88, 9, 'en', 'The personal information we collect may include:', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(89, 10, 'en', 'Student and Parent Information', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(90, 11, 'en', 'Online and Website Information', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
