(121, 42, 'en', 'Data Security', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(122, 43, 'en', 'We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect the security of your personal information against unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the Internet or method of electronic storage is completely secure.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(123, 44, 'en', 'We have implemented the following security measures to protect your data:', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(124, 45, 'en', 'Data encryption during transmission and storage of sensitive information', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(125, 46, 'en', 'Use of multi-factor authentication processes for access to user accounts', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(126, 47, 'en', 'Continuous security reviews and system updates to counter new threats', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(127, 48, 'en', 'Staff training on data protection and security methods', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(128, 49, 'en', 'Cookies and Tracking Technologies', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(129, 50, 'en', 'We use cookies and similar technologies to collect and store information when you visit our website or use our educational system. Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(130, 51, 'en', 'You can set your browser to refuse all cookies or to alert you when a cookie is being sent. However, some features of our website or educational system may not function properly without cookies.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(131, 52, 'en', 'Types of cookies we use:', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(132, 53, 'en', 'Essential Cookies', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(133, 54, 'en', 'Necessary for the core functionality of the website and educational system, such as enabling login and access to secure areas.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(134, 55, 'en', 'Preference Cookies', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(135, 56, 'en', 'Allow us to remember your settings and preferences such as language choice and regional settings.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(136, 57, 'en', 'Statistical Cookies', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(137, 58, 'en', 'Help us understand how users interact with the educational system and improve it.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(138, 59, 'en', 'Functional Cookies', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(139, 60, 'en', 'Used to deliver advanced features, such as remembering partially completed forms and personalization settings.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(140, 61, 'en', 'Your Privacy Rights', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(141, 62, 'en', 'Depending on your location, you may have specific rights regarding your personal information, which may include:', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(142, 63, 'en', 'To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the contact information provided in the \"Contact Us\" section.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(143, 64, 'en', 'The right to access personal information we hold about you', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(144, 65, 'en', 'The right to rectify any inaccurate or incomplete information', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(145, 66, 'en', 'The right to request deletion of personal data in certain circumstances', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(146, 67, 'en', 'The right to restrict processing of personal data in certain circumstances', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(147, 68, 'en', 'The right to data portability to yourself or a third party', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(148, 69, 'en', 'The right to object to processing of personal data in certain circumstances', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(149, 70, 'en', 'Children\'s Privacy', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(150, 71, 'en', 'Given the nature of our educational services, we collect information from students under the age of 18 with the consent and participation of their parents or legal guardians. We especially protect student information and limit access to this information.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(151, 72, 'en', 'Salman Farsi Educational Complex is aware of its responsibility to protect children\'s information and complies with laws and regulations related to children\'s privacy.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(152, 73, 'en', 'Changes to This Privacy Policy', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(153, 74, 'en', 'We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices of collecting or processing personal information. We will change the date of the last update at the top of this page.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(154, 75, 'en', 'We will notify you of any changes by posting the updated policy on our website. We recommend that you regularly review this policy to stay informed of any changes.', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(155, 76, 'en', 'Contact Us', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
(156, 77, 'en', 'If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or how we manage your personal information, please contact us:', '2025-05-16 07:42:30', '2025-05-16 07:42:30'),
